{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"47","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"To the Master of the Choir: A psalm from the Sons of Korah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"All the peoples clap hands, they call unto God with the sound of rejoicing "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"for the Lord is supreme, awe-inspiring, a great King over all the earth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He subdues peoples beneath us and nations under our feet. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He will select our inheritance for us, the pride of Jacob whom He has loved, Selah. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"God arises amidst blasts, the Lord at the sound of the "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n187.jpg","n":"83"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"Shofar. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Sing praise to God, sing to Him, sing to our King, sing praise to Him. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For the King of all the earth is God, sing with intelligent understanding. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"God reigned over peoples, God is seated on His holy throne. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The nobles of the peoples are assembled, the people of the God of Abraham; for the shields of the earth are of God, most exalted is He. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
